              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-zinc-950 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors shadow-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-600"
            >
              Book 15-Min Architecture Review &rarr;
            </a>
